@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# 0102: Training, fixes part 3 of 3
+
+Reported: General #2 (missing corrections), Card #1 (card charged to cash), and a check of every course.
+
+## Changes
+- `Deviation.chain` and `fixCandidates`: the in-window steps of a fix, deepest first; the first on screen is shown. Used for line discount, item price and whole-line price strays. Customer stray points at the x.
+- `Place.view` (`top` or `grid`) and a `place:view:*` stray: another tab, sizes open, or inside a category on a goal that lives on the grid. Used by the Find items other page goal.
+- `Watch.fix`: a watch can offer Start this part again.
+- Card goals: `saleDone` needs every tender of the last sale to be a card. `wrongWays` watches (Cash, Gift card or Split open: close then Card; paid another way: restart). Spots `pay.cash`, `pay.gift`, `pay.split`; Pay publishes which is open.
+
+## Audit (every guide step and goal, all five courses)
+No step is finished by the wrong thing after 0100 to 0102. Left alone, because the target is always on screen where the step runs or the fallback would be a guess: sign-in g-pass-open, g-pass-scan, g-lock, g-pin (no recover); cart g-add-second, g-add-third, g-qty (no grid aim); find-items g-back-sizes, g-back-category, g-search, the tab steps (no recover); pay-card g-tap, g-receipt (inside terminal and receipt windows). Welcome g-tile and sign-in g-open point without a gesture.
+
+## Not covered
+Cart-level discounts, whole-order price and note strays still say to open the cart (no spots for the menu rows yet). Typed-text strays outside the Find items typing steps.
